@startuml
actor "User/System" as US
participant "Router Management Controller" as RMC
participant "Router Management Ports In" as RMPI
participant "Router Management Service" as RMS
participant "Router Management Ports Out" as RMPO
participant "Router Management Http Adapter" as RMHA

== Router Management Flow ==
US -> RMC: Запрос для Router Management Service
RMC -> RMPI
RMPI -> RMS
RMS -> RMPO
RMPO -> RMHA
RMHA --> RMPO
RMPO --> RMS
RMS --> RMPI
RMPI --> RMC
RMC --> US: Ответ от Router Management Service

@enduml
